{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the matching puzzle jungle of Fit My Cat's wild and wacky canine edition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture this: your doggy pals plan to spend the most lazy day and stay at a cozy home with comfy rooms, just for them. But there's a snag \u2013 they're all vying for space on a colossal dog bed and need your finesse to make it work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level unveils a variety of dog breeds, each itching for a spot to lounge and unwind on the bed. Get ready to mingle with 27 breeds, from playful Poodles to cuddly Bulldogs, regal Golden Retrievers to very long Dachshunds, and beyond!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Here's what makes this doggone fun escapade bark to life:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >96 levels of dog beds ready to be filled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >27 different dog breeds with different shapes and sizes</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Puptorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979080/e626bc68d0ff00640d11e9ef178128df28082252.jpg"},{"name":"Pup Scout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979080/372e5a6eeee393d8566840824524b6cbc22b4872.jpg"},{"name":"Treats Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979080/2e0afe945f9f7eb5a134da34396a67aed8162e2d.jpg"},{"name":"Trick Trainer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979080/679020dfdf3839e7125853ce34e4cc4ea4b232dc.jpg"},{"name":"Pack Pal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979080/e6d0f258b9f5992a22ff0adab0456373ea5b0c33.jpg"},{"name":"Ball Chaser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979080/92ad0f04ee69b1bdb4bc2f6afba